  "claims": [
    {
      "id": "claim_f62e914fd85b4a07b59671cc760fee00",
      "statement": "step ca init asserts a usable crypto/rand source (assertCryptoRand) before any other work, refusing to initialize a PKI on a system without one.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://command/ca/init.go#L220-L223",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:9bfe4bf4febe75c1cae5a6115fabac1aa52df95560bbec803fa11ca013f78e84:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_aed9adc61d034e07b037c4830ec4912d",
      "statement": "initAction enforces cross-flag invariants as guard clauses: --root requires --key and vice versa, --ra accepts only StepCAS or CloudCAS, --kms accepts only azurekms, --kms and --ra are mutually exclusive, --pki cannot combine with --no-db or --helm, --remote-management and --acme are incompatible with --no-db, and --admin-subject requires --remote-management.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://command/ca/init.go#L240-L278",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:b9d6c3bc5b04f4afa4b5f7220641cd90dad0c5b134515f3a6f458dfd1511429f:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_fccb33e0472c40d695940678dc319e0d",
      "statement": "init reads the CA key password from --password-file and the provisioner password from --provisioner-password-file (reusing the CA password when absent), and detects context mode via cautils.UseContext, warning users otherwise.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://command/ca/init.go#L281-L302",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:4d60d327ba33c3bc821444db470ea26c3e5dadb23e90dcc5f868252c6f3b2002:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_ca6ae2ec333f4873b06473eac0bb0836",
      "statement": "With --ra CloudCAS, init prompts the deployment type and either collects a full new-PKI spec (org, resource, GCP project/location, CA pool name and tier, GCS bucket, each regex-validated) with IsCreator true, or an existing certificate authority resource name.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://command/ca/init.go#L306-L398",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:3a1774800cfe8936a22a498556e73f1785bb1a550b57b7659d9bd7287a2b7321:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_f55685855bb04033a9c3984890fb6372",
      "statement": "With --ra StepCAS, init prompts for the upstream CA URL (https enforced), the 64-hex root fingerprint, and the JWK provisioner name, assembling apiv1.Options with IsCAGetter true so the root is fetched from the upstream CA rather than created.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://command/ca/init.go#L399-L432",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:9a9d8c35490b0804574549eec0b6c3f7d3f90102bf9e7380362f38ae288b50b5:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_11a447653067484a949ac1538a2ef29f",
      "statement": "The default SoftCAS path prompts the deployment type; hosted deployment short-circuits with instructions to use step ca bootstrap --team instead of initializing; --acme is rejected for non-standalone deployments with a pointer to step ca provisioner add acme --type ACME; and with --kms azurekms the per-key URIs (root, intermediate, SSH host, SSH user) are prompted, validated via the KMS implementation's ValidateName, and become pki.WithKMS/pki.WithKeyURIs options.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://command/ca/init.go#L433-L527",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:b0cf002c29b5d6bcdff39339690ad500076b5a772035dda0ab39659110424777:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_f5b62c8d654247db8877f11f3319bfce",
      "statement": "Unless --pki is set, init collects DNS names and listen address, registers and saves the new context (name defaulting to the first DNS name) when context mode applies, and assembles pki options: address, --with-ca-url (written into defaults.json), DNS names, deployment type, provisioner and super-admin subject (standalone only), admin API for linked or --remote-management, SSH keys, no-database, Helm output, and a default ACME provisioner for standalone+--acme.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://command/ca/init.go#L530-L633",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:b75999f0722645450c9572a188469c1a3e9aeaa9c3d6dee36f3bf2aacf0bae67:"
        },
