    {
      "id": "claim_90079cc4103d4d70945c5ed50fe00911",
      "statement": "Key generation: pki.New constructs the PKI, the password is prompted (empty auto-generates), provisioner key pairs are generated for standalone non-PKI-only mode, the root is generated or copied from --root (the root key is not copied into STEPPATH), the intermediate is always generated for creators, RA getters fetch the root via p.GetCertificateAuthority, --ssh generates SSH signing keys, --helm writes the values template to stdout, and otherwise p.Save() persists the layout.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://command/ca/init.go#L649-L717",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:35f71ef6e39aaaaf5b2fc5f531863b94a8012a9068e0260fe473be4ef76d669c:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_d2cf51ba02c94979846800bed0e22d35",
      "statement": "The physical PKI file layout is written by pki.Save() in the external github.com/smallstep/certificates/pki package; this repository owns the option assembly, the --with-ca-url to defaults.json linkage, and context registration.",
