        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_80b9a36143d740b3b735905559152674",
      "statement": "Bootstrap writes the root to $STEPPATH/certs/root_ca.crt (mode 0600, directories 0700) and the bootstrapConfig JSON (ca-url, fingerprint, root, optional redirect-url, provisioner, min-password-length) to step.DefaultsFile() (mode 0644) with the https-normalized CA URL, pushes ca-url/fingerprint/root into the CLI context, creates the profile defaults file {} when contexts are enabled, and installs the root into the system trust store with --install; BootstrapAuthority derives the context name from the CA URL host or --authority.",
